{"id":"37a60b204014a7b1","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation.md","title":"多项式有界性沿模拟向上保持","display":"thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation — 多项式有界性沿模拟向上保持","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation","aliases":["72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation"],"display":"thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation — 多项式有界性沿模拟向上保持","depends_on":["[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","[[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4 print550,552/PDF562,564; local shortest-size consequences","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation — 多项式有界性沿模拟向上保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4 print550,552/PDF562,564; local shortest-size consequences"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P、Q为同一编码下的证明系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 满足 Q 的每份证明在 P 中有长度至多 b 的同结论证明，方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\le_{\\rm sim}P\">\\(Q\\le_{\\rm sim}P\\)</span>。τ∈TAUT。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_P(\\tau)\\le b(s_Q(\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_P(\\tau)\\le b(s_Q(\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\le_{\\rm sim}P\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(Q)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\le_{\\rm sim}P\\land\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(Q)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\equiv_p Q\\Longrightarrow(\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(Q)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\equiv_p Q\\Longrightarrow(\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(Q)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取一份最短 Q 证明，代入其模拟界即可得到第一式；最短证明存在由系统的满射和自然数良序性保证。复合两个非负系数多项式得第二式。p等价给两个长度模拟，双向使用第二式。全过程只控制存在的短证明，不推断一个能有效找到最短证明的算法。</p>\n","headings":[